ROS2 Jazzy
Python 3, numpy
Running it
# Terminal 1
ros2 run robot_state_publisher robot_state_publisher \
  --ros-args -p robot_description:="$(cat urdf/planar_3r.urdf)"

# Terminal 2
ros2 run planar_3r_control sns_controller

# Terminal 3
rviz2
In RViz: Add → RobotModel, set Fixed Frame to base_link.

